    "description": "Pugmarks India International Enterprises has an exciting opening for a Guest Relations Manager at our Nashik office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Pugmarks India International Enterprises:\nPugmarks India International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Plan and execute banquets, events, and MICE functions\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Event Management\n• Proficiency in GDS Systems\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Flexible working hours\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Nashik, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Pugmarks India International Enterprises!",
